            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bena",
        "text": "I brought you all sweets, just like I promised! Everyone gets a fair share!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Excited Children",
        "text": "Yayyy!!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_369_bena_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bena",
        "text": "Now, did you keep your promise too? Have you figured out what you treasure the most?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Excited Child A",
        "text": "I treasure my beastie bank! Look at all the coins I've saved!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Excited Child B",
        "text": "I planted these flowers myself, they finally sprouted... They're so pretty, and I was wondering if you could preserve them."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_369_bena_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bena",
        "text": "Okay, okay, one at a time! Line up, everybody!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Iris and Bena try to have each child introduce their treasures in an orderly manner, but it seems every one of them is exuding limitless passion."
    },
    {
        "text": "The children's excited voices don't die down for a second, but there's no chaos in Sakiko's eyes. On the contrary, the sight before her is filled with warmth."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
