    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kind Townsperson",
        "text": "Why, if it isn't Sakiko."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kind Townsperson",
        "text": "What brings you home so suddenly?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "Sorry, who...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_290_vigna_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vigna",
        "text": "We just happened to have a field mission in the area, so I figured I'd bring Sakiko along, get her to pay her family a visit while she's here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_243",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kind Townsperson",
        "text": "Your father's been talking about you every day, you know? He says you've been so busy interning at a large company, you hardly ever write home."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kind Townsperson",
        "text": "I've never seen him that talkative. He must really miss you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kind Townsperson",
        "text": "You should hurry home. Give him a nice surprise, and lift that weight off his shoulders!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_290_vigna_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vigna",
        "text": "(Whispers) Sakiko, you've been acting kinda weird... Like, your reactions are kinda slow."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "Um... Pardon me, how do I get home from here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
