        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "I lost track of the time... I'll have to remake it from scratch..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "I was taking classes for a good while to learn to make your favorite dishes, Sakiko. How about a taste?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "Father? I thought you never used to cook."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "I have a lot more time on my hands nowadays, so I thought I might as well try something new."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "And look at you... How much weight have you lost..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "We have regular medical evaluations at Rhodes Island\u2014I weigh just as much as I did before."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "No, you've definitely lost some weight!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "With a worried look on his face, Sakiko's 'father' reaches a hand out to pat his daughter's head."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her father's hand feels at once unfamiliar and nostalgic."
    },
    {
        "text": "As she remembers it, she would always be stooping down, her drunken father's arm over her shoulder, as they slowly inched homeward one step at a time."
    },
    {
        "text": "His hand hung ever so feebly before her eyes, as close as it was just now, but so, so different..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "I'm not a child anymore. Please don't..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "Well, you'll always be my most darling daughter."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "Don't want you forgetting your smile, not even while you're out working."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "...Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The two of them smile at each other. The hesitation in Sakiko's mind is cast aside."
    },
    {
        "text": "She's certain that this smile of hers, right now, is true and genuine."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_smoothpiano",
            "volume": 0.2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 4
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "I can hear piano from upstairs... Do we have a guest today?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "Hm? What are you talking about, Sakiko?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "Surely that's Mizuho practicing the piano."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "...Mother?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "Well, yes! It's always been you and Mizuho who know how to play it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "Oh, right, I haven't told Mizuho you're back yet."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1940_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Father",
        "text": "She's going to be overjoyed to see you. You should head on up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
