    {
        "text": "The piano was her mother's favorite instrument. That is why Sakiko loves the piano."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko's mother would hold Sakiko's hands so gently, and teach her to feel her way around each and every key, black and white."
    },
    {
        "text": "In the days following her mother's death, Sakiko could still vividly recall every moment of her time spent with her mother, and kept playing song after song her mother had taught her."
